The CCA are trying to make a final stand to the might of the People's Republic, Major. They have withdrawn to a large base carved out of a hillside, and are trying to defend themselves. There is one heavily-guarded entrance to the base, which we are trying to take now. You will be given further orders as necessary.
The only tank available in this sector upon your return from Europa was badly damaged and short of ammunition. For this reason, you are to stay in the base area and await a production convoy which will arrive shortly.

MISSION OBJECTIVES:
- Destroy the Russian base.

INTELLIGENCE REPORT:
The Russians are using a new power supply, which would seem to have a longer range than their standard ones. A side-effect of this is a powerful electromagnetic field, which is more than likely to short out your cloak, should you go too close to them.